---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="The Work" description="Strategic briefs with measurable outcomes.">
  <section class="container section grid gap-8">
    <div class="reveal flex flex-col gap-4">
      <span class="kicker">The Briefs</span>
      <h1 class="serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Proof of the why behind the what.</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[color:var(--muted)] max-w-2xl">
        Each engagement is framed by the tension, the insight, and the outcome. Strategy as a
        bridge, not a slide deck.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6">
      <article class="group reveal border border-[color:var(--line)] rounded-2xl p-6 bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
          <h2 class="serif text-2xl">Global Digital Transformation</h2>
          <span class="tag">Sotheby's</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-6 text-sm">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Tension</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              A home database experience was under-serving the brand's luxury lifestyle narrative.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative">
            <p class="kicker">The Insight</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)] opacity-100 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
              Shift from transactions to storytelling with a video-centric, global gallery.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Outcome</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              A fully responsive, internationalized mobile experience that defined the luxury standard.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group reveal border border-[color:var(--line)] rounded-2xl p-6 bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
          <h2 class="serif text-2xl">The "Pizza Tracker"</h2>
          <span class="tag">WFG</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-6 text-sm">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Tension</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              Real estate felt like a black box for consumers with no visibility post-contract.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Insight</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)] opacity-100 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
              Build a MyHome dashboard that reveals every milestone in the transaction.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Outcome</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              WFG's CTO named Inman Innovator of the Year for the transparency initiative.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group reveal border border-[color:var(--line)] rounded-2xl p-6 bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
          <h2 class="serif text-2xl">The Professional Workspace</h2>
          <span class="tag">Bright MLS</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-6 text-sm">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Tension</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              Fragmented tools forced agents to juggle multiple workflows with inconsistent data.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Insight</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)] opacity-100 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
              Consolidate the workflow into a single, indispensable daily workspace.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Outcome</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              A new product used by 95,000+ subscribers across the Bright MLS network.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
